{"seq":1,"slug":"market-risk","title":"市场风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/financial-engineering/risk-management/market-risk","wordCount":637,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"市场风险\">市场风险</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>市场风险是因市场价格（股价、利率、汇率、商品价格）不利变动而导致损失的风险。它是金融机构面临的最主要风险类型之一。理解市场风险对程序员而言，既关系个人投资管理，也是开发风控系统和量化交易系统的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[市场风险] --&gt; B[股票风险]&#10;    A --&gt; C[利率风险]&#10;    A --&gt; D[汇率风险]&#10;    A --&gt; E[商品风险]&#10;    B --&gt; F[系统性风险/Beta]&#10;    B --&gt; G[非系统性风险/Alpha]&#10;    F --&gt; H[无法分散]&#10;    G --&gt; I[可通过分散化消除]\">graph TD\n    A[市场风险] --&gt; B[股票风险]\n    A --&gt; C[利率风险]\n    A --&gt; D[汇率风险]\n    A --&gt; E[商品风险]\n    B --&gt; F[系统性风险/Beta]\n    B --&gt; G[非系统性风险/Alpha]\n    F --&gt; H[无法分散]\n    G --&gt; I[可通过分散化消除]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险类型</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>衡量指标</th>\n<th>对冲工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>股票风险</td>\n<td>股价波动</td>\n<td>Beta、波动率</td>\n<td>股指期货、期权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利率风险</td>\n<td>利率变动</td>\n<td>久期、DV01</td>\n<td>利率互换、国债期货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率风险</td>\n<td>汇率波动</td>\n<td>汇率敞口</td>\n<td>外汇远期、期权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品风险</td>\n<td>大宗商品价格</td>\n<td>价格敞口</td>\n<td>商品期货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波动率风险</td>\n<td>波动率变化</td>\n<td>Vega</td>\n<td>波动率互换</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"var-在险价值\">VaR：在险价值</h2><p>VaR（Value at Risk）是市场风险衡量的行业标准：在给定置信水平和时间区间下，投资组合可能遭受的最大损失。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface VaRResult {&#10;  parametric: number;&#10;  historical: number;&#10;  confidenceLevel: number;&#10;  timeHorizon: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const parametricVaR = (&#10;  portfolioValue: number,&#10;  dailyReturn: number,&#10;  dailyVolatility: number,&#10;  confidence: number,&#10;  days: number,&#10;): number =&gt; {&#10;  const zScores: Record&lt;number, number&gt; = { 0.95: 1.645, 0.99: 2.326, 0.999: 3.09 };&#10;  const z = zScores[confidence] ?? 1.645;&#10;  return portfolioValue * (dailyReturn * days - z * dailyVolatility * Math.sqrt(days));&#10;};&#10;&#10;const historicalVaR = (returns: number[], portfolioValue: number, confidence: number): number =&gt; {&#10;  const sorted = [...returns].sort((a, b) =&gt; a - b);&#10;  const index = Math.floor(sorted.length * (1 - confidence));&#10;  return portfolioValue * sorted[index];&#10;};&#10;&#10;const dailyReturns = Array.from({ length: 252 }, () =&gt; (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.04);&#10;const portfolioValue = 1000000;&#10;&#10;const pVaR = parametricVaR(portfolioValue, 0.0003, 0.015, 0.95, 1);&#10;const hVaR = historicalVaR(dailyReturns, portfolioValue, 0.95);&#10;&#10;console.log(`参数法VaR(95%, 1天): ¥${Math.abs(Math.round(pVaR))}`);&#10;console.log(`历史模拟VaR(95%, 1天): ¥${Math.abs(Math.round(hVaR))}`);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VaRResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  parametric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  historical</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  confidenceLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span s